OL,3,ACurfew imposed in parts of central
OL,4,AParis and other cities after rioting
OL,5,Aacross France
OL,6,
OL,7,FPartial curfews variously restricting
OL,8,Fthe movement of young people and
OL,9,Fgatherings were announced for cities
OL,10,Fincluding Marseille, Bordeaux, Nice and
OL,11,FLyon in the south as well as Lille and
OL,12,Fother towns in the north.
